Doing a bit more digging (I just can't help it!), here https://github.com/kubernetes/kubernetes/blob/c285e781331a3785a7f436042c65c5641ce8a9e9/pkg/kubelet/stats/cadvisor_stats_provider.go#L90 (which in turn calls `cadvisor` directly here https://github.com/kubernetes/kubernetes/blob/c285e781331a3785a7f436042c65c5641ce8a9e9/pkg/kubelet/stats/cadvisor_stats_provider.go#L405-L409
), returned `infos` doesn't contain any exited init containers data, so the filtering is done by `cadvisor`.

`cadvisor` was bumped in https://github.com/kubernetes/kubernetes/pull/106282 from v0.39.2 to v0.43.0, so I'm guessing the fix should be somewhere [in there](https://github.com/google/cadvisor/compare/v0.39.2...v0.43.0).
